spriteWall[0] | 54, 54, 16, 16 | Ordinary wall, set 1 of 2. The game loads this cell, but never draws it as a join. A tile with no connections uses the row of lone tiles instead. It's also the inside corner for a wall one tile thick, drawn where two connected sides meet and the tile diagonally between them doesn't join. As painted it's the north-east corner, and the game turns it for the other three.
